;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"All right, good work. Lead the way."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ワゴン発見.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"So this is the stolen white minivan. 
{PAUSE ""}
Dumped right by the road like this, looks like nobody even tried to hide it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Who was the first to find it?"<PG>
"I see, a resident nearby thought the car looked strange and asked us to come take a look. 
{PAUSE ""}
All right, I'm opening it."<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\se_horror2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ワゴン発見赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\se_fuon2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Ugh! What is this?! Looks awful, and the smell's just as awful... 
{PAUSE ""}
The weapon and the tools left as they were, and on top of that, even the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="は">stripped</STYLE>-off skin left lying here... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, close this area off right away. 
{PAUSE ""}
Send some of the Central Park squad over here!"<PG>
"Damn... this is awful. 
{PAUSE ""}
Going by the method and the date, we can probably take this as a continuation of the Megasawa City case. 
{PAUSE ""}
The crime scene is inside this minivan. 
{PAUSE ""}
But leaving this much evidence behind... 
{PAUSE ""}
if anything, that means we can't be optimistic."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hello? Yeah, it's me. 
{PAUSE ""}
You said <STYLE ID="2">Akane Kogori-san</STYLE> is at the station? Put her through."<PG>
"Hello, this is Motoki Police Station, Inspector Ise. 
{PAUSE ""}
Uh... this was all so sudden today. I can only imagine how you feel. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes... yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
As for the remains... 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah, you've seen them. 
{PAUSE ""}
Actually, about that, it does appear to be connected to that Megasawa City case after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
If that's so, we believe there will be more victims, so..."<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
"Do you have any idea where your daughter, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE>, might have gone?"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
